<section class="gg-hero">
  <div class="gg-container gg-hero-grid">
    <div class="gg-hero-copy">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Goal Grower App</span>
      <h1>Grow into the person you are trying to become.</h1>
      <p>
        A calming goal tracker where habits, big goals, and shared progress become a garden you can actually care about.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support Development</a>
        <a href="#app-preview" class="gg-btn-soft">See the App</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-hero-showcase" id="app-preview">
      <div class="gg-screenshot-main">
        <div class="gg-screenshot-placeholder">
          <span>Add App Screenshot</span>
          <small>Home / Garden screen</small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-screenshot-row">
        <div class="gg-mini-shot">
          <span>Add Screenshot</span>
        </div>
        <div class="gg-mini-shot">
          <span>Add Screenshot</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-nav-story">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Simple idea</span>
      <h2>Progress feels easier when it feels alive.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is built to feel less like a checklist and more like a quiet place to return to.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-card-grid">
      <div class="gg-info-card">
        <span class="gg-number">01</span>
        <h3>Plant a goal</h3>
        <p>Create a habit, project, or personal goal and give it a place in your garden.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-info-card">
        <span class="gg-number">02</span>
        <h3>Water it with action</h3>
        <p>Each completed step helps your goal grow visually over time.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-info-card">
        <span class="gg-number">03</span>
        <h3>Grow with others</h3>
        <p>Create shared gardens with friends, family, or accountability partners.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-app-section">
  <div class="gg-container gg-two-col">
    <div>
      <span class="gg-kicker">App functionality</span>
      <h2>Designed for habits and big goals.</h2>
      <p>
        Track daily routines, long-term goals, shared accountability, and progress without making productivity feel cold.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-function-list">
      <div>
        <strong>Personal garden</strong>
        <span>See all your goals in one calming place.</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>Shared gardens</strong>
        <span>Grow with people who are working on their own goals too.</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>Progress feedback</strong>
        <span>Your effort becomes visual, emotional, and easier to remember.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-screenshot-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <span class="gg-kicker">App preview</span>
      <h2>Show the experience clearly.</h2>
      <p>Replace these cards with real screenshots from Goal Grower.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-screenshot-grid">
      <div class="gg-shot-card large">
        <span>Add screenshot</span>
        <small>Garden dashboard</small>
      </div>
      <div class="gg-shot-card">
        <span>Add screenshot</span>
        <small>Goal creation</small>
      </div>
      <div class="gg-shot-card">
        <span>Add screenshot</span>
        <small>Shared garden</small>
      </div>
      <div class="gg-shot-card">
        <span>Add screenshot</span>
        <small>Progress screen</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-products-section">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Store</span>
      <h2>Support the app and future products.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is the main project, but the store can also support other apps, digital products, and physical products.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-product-lanes">
      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-lane-card">
        <h3>Goal Grower Support</h3>
        <p>Support development, testing, and future app features.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-lane-card">
        <h3>Digital Products</h3>
        <p>Templates, planners, tools, and resources connected to intentional growth.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-lane-card">
        <h3>Physical Products</h3>
        <p>Merch, desk items, and calming productivity products.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-final-cta">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <span class="gg-kicker">The mission</span>
    <h2>Build a life you can keep returning to.</h2>
    <p>
      Goal Grower is about making progress feel human, hopeful, and worth caring about.
    </p>
    <a href="/pages/support" class="gg-btn">Support the Mission</a>
  </div>
</section>

